# Firmware tests

`test_telemetry_policy` runs on the native host target and exercises the same
header-only policy used by the ESP32: distance/heading math, three-reading
motion hysteresis, capped jittered retry, change thresholds, the three-second
publish floor and moving/stopped heartbeats.

Run `platformio test --project-dir hardware -e native`. GNSS/UART/Wi-Fi/TLS,
watchdog and power behavior still require the bench and vehicle matrix in
`../../testing/TEST_STRATEGY.md`; never describe host tests or a compile as a
physical hardware pass.
